{"id": "22-4036-2-2", "zh": "以 u、ū 结尾的词根的变化形式", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4037-2-34", "zh": "Cu 义为“坠落”，ju 义为“快速行走”，thu 义为“赞叹”，du 义为“行走”与“折磨”，bhū 义为“存在”，yu 义为“混合”与“行走”，ru 义为“发声”，brū 义为“清楚地言说”，su 义为“流动”与“产生”，sū 义为“生产”，hu 义为“给予、食用、供奉与能够”，hū 义为“存在”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4038-2-22", "zh": "生成 ti 等语尾；依“主动语态加 la”规则加 la 词缀；u、ū 替换为 av；依“元音变长”规则，及物词根在 kya 之前元音变长。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4039-2-7", "zh": "Cu 义为坠落：cavati、cavanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4040-2-5", "zh": "加 ṇi 时：cāveti、cāvayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4041-2-7", "zh": "Ju 义为快速行走：javati、javanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4042-2-7", "zh": "Thu 义为赞叹：abhitthavati、abhitthavanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4043-2-20", "zh": "由于“bahulaṃ（多样地）”一语的管辖，在 kya 之前有时元音强化，并替换为 av：abhitthavīyati、abhitthavīyanti、abhitthaviyyati、abhitthaviyyanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4044-2-7", "zh": "Du 义为折磨：upaddavati、upaddavanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4045-2-7", "zh": "Bhū 义为存在：sambhoti、sambhavati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4046-2-6", "zh": "Yu 义为行走：yavati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4047-2-11", "zh": "Ru 义为发声：ravati、ravanti、viravati、viravanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4048-2-4", "zh": "Brū 义为清楚地言说——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4049-2-7", "zh": "618. brū 不变为 o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4050-2-8", "zh": "后面接辅音时，brū 不变为 o。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4051-2-3", "zh": "Brūti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4052-2-36", "zh": "619. 在 brū 之后，ti 加 īu。[ka.520; rū.502; nī.1033; caṃ.6.2.34; pā.7.3.93]", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4053-2-7", "zh": "在 brū 之后，ti 的开头加上 īu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4053-8-10", "zh": "在 ī 之前，前面的元音脱落。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4054-2-3", "zh": "Bravīti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4055-2-27", "zh": "620. i、ī 与 u、ū 在元音之前变为 iyaṅ、uvaṅ。[ka.70; rū.30; nī.220; 多数版本作 …miyavuvaṅa…]", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4056-2-12", "zh": "以 i、ī 和 u、ū 结尾的词根，在元音之前有时变为 iyaṅ、uvaṅ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4057-2-6", "zh": "bruvanti，或 brunti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4057-7-16", "zh": "“Ajānantā no pabruntī”（不知道的人对我们说），这是圣典用例。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4057-17-24", "zh": "brūsi、brūtha、brūmi、brūma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4058-2-36", "zh": "621. ti、anti 变为 ṭa、ṭū。[ka.517; rū.488; nī.1105; caṃ.1.4.13; pā.3.4.84]", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4059-2-14", "zh": "在 ti、anti 之前，brū 变为 āha，而 ti、anti 分别变为 ṭa、ṭū。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4060-2-7", "zh": "So āha（他说），te āhu（他们说）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4061-2-27", "zh": "这里有以下圣典用例：“nibbānaṃ bhagavā āha, sabbaganthapamocanaṃ”（世尊说涅槃能解脱一切系缚），“āha tesañca yo nirodho”（也说了它们的灭）[mahāva.60]；“yaṃ pare sukhato āhu, tadariyā āhu dukkhato”（别人说是乐的，圣者们说是苦）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4061-28-43", "zh": "“Yaṃ pare dukkhato āhu, tadariyā sukhato vidū”（别人说是苦的，圣者们知道是乐）[su.ni.767]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4061-44-50", "zh": "其中，“āha”的意思是 katheti（他说）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4061-51-56", "zh": "“Āhu”的意思是 kathenti（他们说）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4062-2-24", "zh": "brūtu、brūvantu、“brūhi maṅgalamuttamaṃ”（请说最上的吉祥）[khu.pā.5.2]、brūtha、brūmi、brūma。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4063-2-9", "zh": "在 eyya 等语尾之前，brū 变为 uvaṅ：bruveyya、bruveyyuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4064-2-17", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾的元音之前，brū 变为 o，o 再替换为 av：abravi、abravuṃ、abraviṃsu。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4065-2-7", "zh": "替换为 uv 时：abruvi、abruvuṃ、abruviṃsu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4066-2-3", "zh": "在远过去时（parokkha）中——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4067-2-20", "zh": "622. 在 a 等语尾之前，brū 变为 āha。[ka.475; rū.465; nī.956]", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4068-2-6", "zh": "在 a 等语尾之前，brū 变为 āha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4069-2-7", "zh": "So āha（他说），te āhu（他们说）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4070-2-12", "zh": "623. 在 āha 之后，u 可变为 aṃsu。[nī.1036]", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4071-2-8", "zh": "在替换形 āha 之后，u 语尾可以变为 aṃsu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4072-2-20", "zh": "te āhaṃsu（他们说过）；“saccaṃ kirevamāhaṃsu, narā ekacciyā idha”（据说这里有些人确实这样说过）[jā.1.13.123]。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4073-2-11", "zh": "Su 义为流动：nadī savati（河水流淌）、savanti、ābhavaggā savanti（一直流到有顶）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4074-2-13", "zh": "Sū 义为生产：puññaṃ pasavati（产生福德）[cūḷava.354]、pasavanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4075-2-21", "zh": "Hu 义为供奉：依“parokkhāyañca”规则重叠词根，依“kavaggahānaṃ cavaggajā”规则 h 变为 j：juhoti、juhonti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4076-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：tena aggi hūyate（火被他供奉）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4077-2-5", "zh": "加 ṇi 时：juhāveti、juhāvayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4078-2-5", "zh": "加 ṇāpi 时：juhāpeti、juhāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4079-2-11", "zh": "Hu 义为能够：pahoti、sampahoti、pahonti、sampahonti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4080-2-12", "zh": "Hū 义为存在：hoti、honti、hotu、hontu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4081-2-14", "zh": "在 eyya 等语尾之前，依“yuvaṇṇānamiyaṅauvaṅa sare”规则，词根末尾替换为 uv：huveyya、huveyyuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4082-2-4", "zh": "在 ā 等语尾之前：so ahuvā（他曾经是）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4082-5-19", "zh": "“Vaṇṇagandhaphalūpeto, amboyaṃ ahuvā pure”（这棵芒果树从前色、香、果俱全）[jā.1.2.71]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4082-20-68", "zh": "“Ahuvā te pure sakhā”（他从前是你的朋友）[saṃ.ni.1.50]；te ahuvū，tvaṃ ahuvo，tumhe ahuvattha [ma.ni.1.215]；“jhāyatha bhikkhave mā pamādattha, mā pacchā vippaṭisārino ahuvattha”（比丘们，你们要禅修，不要放逸，免得日后后悔）；ahuva 或 ahuvaṃ，ahuvamhā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4082-69-87", "zh": "“Akaramhasa te kiccaṃ, yaṃ balaṃ ahuvamhase”（我们已经尽自己的力量为你办了事）[jā.1.4.29]。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4082-88-107", "zh": "“Ahuvamheva mayaṃ pubbe, na nāhuvamhā”（我们从前确实存在过，并非不曾存在）[ma.ni.1.180]——这些都是圣典用例。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4083-2-8", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾之前加入 s 音：ahosi、pāturahosi。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4084-2-6", "zh": "依大规则，ī 脱落，元音变短。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4084-7-11", "zh": "“Ahudeva bhayaṃ ahu chambhitattaṃ”（生起了恐惧，生起了惊怖）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4084-12-22", "zh": "“Ahudeva kukkuccaṃ, ahu vippaṭisāro”（生起了恶作，生起了后悔）[pārā.38]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4084-23-34", "zh": "“Ādīnavo pāturahu”（过患显现了）[theragā.269]，“dibbo ratho pāturahu”（天车出现了）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4085-2-20", "zh": "624. 在 hū 之后变为 resuṃ。[ka.517; rū.488; nī.1105]", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4086-2-6", "zh": "在 hū 之后，uṃ 语尾变为 resuṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4086-7-11", "zh": "依规则的拆分适用，mhā 也变为 resumhā。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-4086-12-17", "zh": "依“rānubandhentasarādissā”规则，词根末尾脱落。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4087-2-5", "zh": "Te pubbe ahesuṃ（他们从前存在过）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4087-6-11", "zh": "替换为 uv 时作 ahuvuṃ；前面的元音脱落时作 ahuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4088-2-20", "zh": "这里有以下圣典用例：“sabbamhi taṃ araññamhi, yāvantettha dijā ahuṃ”（在那整片森林里，这里所有的鸟）[jā.2.22.2425]。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4088-21-35", "zh": "“Kūṭāgārasahassāni, sabbasoṇṇamayā ahuṃ”（上千座楼阁，全都由黄金造成）[apa.thera 1.1.407]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4089-2-9", "zh": "o 语尾变为 si、ittha、ttho。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4089-10-18", "zh": "tvaṃ ahosi、ahuvi、ahuvittha、ahuvittho（你曾经是）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4090-2-77", "zh": "依大规则，o 脱落，元音变短：“mā bhoti kupitā ahu”（夫人，请不要生气）[jā.2.22.1931]，“māhu pacchānutāpinī”（不要日后懊悔）[saṃ.ni.1.162]；“ahosiṃ nu kho ahaṃ atītamaddhānaṃ, na nu kho ahosiṃ, kinnu kho ahosiṃ, kathaṃ nu kho ahosiṃ”（我在过去世存在过吗？我没有存在过吗？我过去是什么？我过去是怎样的？）[saṃ.ni.2.20; ma.ni.1.18]；ahaṃ ahuviṃ；mayaṃ ahosimhā，或 ahosimha。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4090-78-106", "zh": "“Ahesumhā nu kho mayaṃ atītamaddhānaṃ, na nu kho ahesumhā, kinnu kho ahesumhā, kathaṃ nu kho ahesumhā”（我们在过去世存在过吗？我们没有存在过吗？我们过去是什么？我们过去是怎样的？）[ma.ni.1.407]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4090-107-113", "zh": "Mayaṃ pubbe ahuvimhā，或 ahumhā（我们从前存在过）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4090-114-133", "zh": "“Mayaṃ pubbe dānapatino ahumhā”（我们从前是施主）[jā.2.22.1617]，这是圣典用例。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4091-2-3", "zh": "元音变短时：ahumha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4092-2-5", "zh": "依大规则，mhā 也变为 u。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4092-6-18", "zh": "“Pañcasatā mayaṃ sabbā, tāvatiṃsupagā ahun”（我们全部五百人，都往生到了三十三天），这是圣典用例。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4093-2-12", "zh": "在后一组语尾中，a 变为 aṃ：ahaṃ pubbe ahuvaṃ（我从前存在过），或 ahuva。", "confidence": 55}
